<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
    <style>
        {{{inlineResetStyles}}}
        {{{inlineStyles}}}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <header>
            <div class="text--right txt txt--xs">PC-1.FF (Rev. 1-2021)</div>
            <div class="text--center">
                <h2 class="mt-16 uppercase">PROBATE COURT OF FRANKLIN COUNTY, OHIO</h2>
                <h4 class="uppercase">JEFFREY D. MACKEY, JUDGE</h4>
            </div>
        </header>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4">
                <div class="txt txt--m uppercase w-auto">
                    <p>IN THE MATTER OF <br>THE GUARDIANSHIP OF</p>
                </div>
                <div class="input fullw">{{webcheckWaiverStep.guardianName}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4 mt-16">
                <div class="txt txt--m uppercase w-auto">
                    <p>CASE NO.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="input w-auto mw-200">{{webcheckWaiverStep.caseNumber}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text--center mt-20">
                <h2>WEBCHECK WAIVER</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="text--left mt-20">
                <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>I hereby certify that I have given the Franklin County Probate Court permission to obtain all criminal history information pertaining to me in the files of the Ohio Bureau of Criminal Identification and Investigation (BCI&I).</p>
                </div>
                <div class="txt txt--s mt-16 pt-16">
                    <p>Further, I understand that my criminal history information received from BCI&I will be filed as a confidential record in the Court’s record keeping system and I will not receive a copy.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-100 pt-60 grid col-2 gap-20">
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw"></div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs mt-4">Date</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw"></div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs mt-4">Applicant's Signature</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row mt-10">
                        <div class="input fullw">{{webcheckWaiverStep.applicantName}}</div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs mt-4">Typed or Printed Name</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="mt-auto">
            <div class="text--center fw-600 txt txt--s uppercase">
                FRANKLIN COUNTY FORM 1.FF - WEBCHECK WAIVER
            </div>
            <div class="txt txt--s">fw</div>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>